### 2. Working with Individual Cell Widths (`Word.TableCell`)
If you want to inspect a specific cell's width or its column width on a row-by-row basis, use `table.getCell(rowIndex, cellIndex)` or row cell collections[2]:

```javascript
await Word.run(async (context) => {
    const table = context.document.body.tables.getFirst();

